      "imageHash": "sha256:88df84f09535e9f986b302c6d4ceee580f1c33b74b9534ae8840a310e65c43d8",
      "observation": "An independent close view corroborates the iron figures on either side of the join, the folds, broad right-hand vessel and the raised finials."
