  "limitations": [
    "The side photograph establishes the double upsweep of the shelter. The corrugated metal graph represents the ribbed outer covering. Exact dimensions, material and rear wall depths remain estimated.",
    "The separate roadside arch, clay relief wall and two iron leaves follow the 2019 exterior photo and 2022 virtual tour. The shape behind the visible sculpted surfaces remains estimated.",
    "The published virtual tour and PMTiles constrain the location and bearing at the western approach. The modeled apron and south footing have been fitted against local terrain. The precise extent of the paving and the verge grade remain inferred.",
    "Distinct motifs on the iron leaves follow the photographed bent drummer and his drum, stretched fish-tailed figure, broad bowl and seated bearer, draped standing musicians and large incised vessel. Fine facial relief and tool marks remain interpreted."
  ],
